# KPI Definitions

| KPI | Description |
|------|-------------|
| Total Sales | Total revenue generated |
| Total Profit | Total profit earned |
| Profit Margin | Percentage of profit from total sales |
| Total Orders | Number of customer orders |
| Total Customers | Number of unique customers |
| Average Order Value | Average revenue per order |
| Total Quantity Sold | Total products sold |
| Average Discount | Average discount offered |
| Monthly Sales Growth | Month-over-month sales comparison |
| Top Product | Product with highest sales |
| Top Customer | Customer generating highest revenue |
| Best Region | Region with highest sales |
